ionally wrapped in parentheses. Booleans must be capitalized True/False (T/F also accepted); \u0027:\u0027 or \u0027=\u0027 may be used as the separator. List every variable you are assigning. Example: (x1:True,x2:False,x3:True)","instance":"(v0_0|v0_1|v0_2)\u0026(!v0_0|!v0_1)\u0026(!v0_0|!v0_2)\u0026(!v0_1|!v0_2)\u0026(v1_0|v1_1|v1_2)\u0026(!v1_0|!v1_1)\u0026(!v1_0|!v1_2)\u0026(!v1_1|!v1_2)\u0026(v2_0|v2_1|v2_2)\u0026(!v2_0|!v2_1)\u0026(!v2_0|!v2_2)\u0026(!v2_1|!v2_2)\u0026(v3_0|v3_1|v3_2)\u0026(!v3_0|!v3_1)\u0026(!v3_0|!v3_2)\u0026(!v3_1|!v3_2)\u0026(v4_0|v4_1|v4_2)\u0026(!v4_0|!v4_1)\u0026(!v4_0|!v4_2)\u0026(!v4_1|!v4_2)\u0026(v5_0|v5_1|v5_2)\u0026(!v5_0|!v5_1)\u0026(!v5_0|!v5_2)\u0026(!v5_1|!v5_2)\u0026(!v0_0|!v1_0)\u0026(!v0_1|!v1_1)\u0026(!v0_2|!v1_2)\u0026(!v1_0|!v2_0)\u0026(!v1_1|!v2_1)\u0026(!v1_2|!v2_2)\u0026(!v2_0|!v0_0)\u0026(!v2_1|!v0_1)\u0026(!v2_2|!v0_2)\u0026(!v0_0|!v3_0)\u0026(!v0_1|!v3_1)\u0026(!v0_2|!v3_2)\u0026(!v1_0|!v4_0)\u0026(!v1_1|!v4_1)\u0026(!v1_2|!v4_2)\u0026(!v2_0|!v5_0)\u0026(!v2_1|!v5_1)\u0026(!v2_2|!v5_2)\u0026(!v3_0|!v4_0)\u0026(!v3_1|!v4_1)\u0026(!v3_2|!v4_2)\u0026(!v4_0|!v5_0)\u0026(!v4_1|!v5_1)\u0026(!v4_2|!v5_2)\u0026(!v5_0|!v3_0)\u0026(!v5_1|!v3_1)\u0026(!v5_2|!v3_2)","wikiName":"","circuit":"","defaultSolver":{"solverName":"SAT Brute Force","solverDefinition":"This is a simple brute force solver for SAT","source":"","sourceFile":"Problems/NPComplete/NPC_SAT/Solvers/SATBruteForceSolver.cs","timerHasExpired":false,"solverType":"BruteForce","solverTypes":["BruteForce"],"complexityBucket":"Exponential","timeComplexity":{"Function":"2^n * |phi|","Description":", n = number of variables, |phi| = formula size","VariableNames":["n","phi"]},"contributors":["Daniel Igbokwe","Show Pratoomratana"]},"defaultVerifier":{"verifierName":"SAT Solution Verifier","verifierDefinition":"This is a verifier for SAT","source":"","sourceFile":"Problems/NPComplete/NPC_SAT/Verifiers/SATVerifier.cs","contributors":["Daniel Igbokwe","Show Pratoomratana"],"c